#!/usr/bin/python3 -I
"""cseries-runtime: starts the containers a standalone C-Series Host asks for.

Run by cseries-runtime.service on the socket cseries-runtime.socket passes
(/run/cseries-runtime/runtime.sock); only the Host container can connect.
The code is in /usr/local/lib/cseries-runtime/cseries_runtime.

  cseries-runtime [--socket PATH]
"""
